Package: IsoTrac
Title: Extract intact glycoprotein masses from hRp-DIA-PTCR data using isotope matching
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person("Tim S", "Veth", email = "tveth@uw.edu", role = c("aut", "cre")),
      person("Nicholas M", "Riley", email = "nmriley@uw.edu", role = "aut"))
Description: IsoTrac deconvolutes hRp-DIA-PTCR data using isotope matching.
    Its input are files prepared with PTsliCR or custom prepared data with the
    same formatting. It will output quality control plots, visualizations of
    the extracted intact masses, and detailed logs, including the intact masses.
